# tasks/ is per-feature execution scratch (task checklists, status) with no
# lasting value once a PR merges, so it's gitignored. spec/ is deliberately
# NOT gitignored - it documents lasting design decisions (scope, acceptance
# criteria, rationale) worth keeping in history alongside the code it
# describes, unlike a todo list.
/tasks/